## Limitations & Assessment Notes

- **Read-Only Discovery:** `php2shell-check` performs passive version and configuration inspection without sending exploit payloads or executing untrusted binaries.
- **Configuration Mitigations:** INI or FPM pool mitigations apply only to `CVE-2026-109619` and never alter the vulnerability verdict. `CVE-2026-109618` has no known configuration mitigation.
- **Vendor Backports:** When `advisory.verified` is `false` or distribution backport versions are not listed in `distro_fixes`, distro-managed packages below the upstream fix version are reported as `LIKELY_VULNERABLE`.
